# PostMotive core rule

PostMotive is an AI Marketing Director for small-business owners with little marketing experience.

Always optimize for:

- Fewer clicks
- Clear recommended next action
- Guided defaults
- Plain language
- Mobile usability
- Cost control
- Reliable completion
- Visible status and recovery paths

Do not turn a simple workflow into a configuration screen. Do not ask users to become prompt engineers.
